Hi!<br>I just bought a second hand MD-9600 V2.1 and i decided to install the latest 2023 12 12 firmware. All was ok and the radio works perfectly with my DM-1801/RD-5R/RT-3S codeplug ! Except my settings are lost each time i power cycle the radio. I tried the 2023 02 28 firmware as it is noticed that the settings are saved into flash memory, and this firmware works ! Why the latest don't save my settings ?<br>Thank you !! 73's.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=3055">F1UPC</a> — Thu Dec 21, 2023 9:47 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
